Console
The decrease in net revenues from console for 2019, as compared to 2018, was primarily due to:
•
lower revenues recognized from the Destiny franchise (reflecting our sale of the publishing rights for Destiny to Bungie in December 2018); and
•
lower revenues recognized from Call of Duty franchise catalog titles.
The decrease was partially offset by revenues recognized from Crash Team Racing Nitro-Fueled, which was released in June 2019.
